# Trellis：规划与 spec 产物入库；运行时状态与大体积回滚材料不入库
# （.trellis/.gitignore 已覆盖 .developer / .current-task / .runtime/ / .backup-* 等）
.trellis/tasks/**/rollback/
.trellis/tasks/**/snapshot/
.trellis/.template-hashes.json

# 本地构建与打包产物
tmp/

# OpenSpec change 工作流过程产物
openspec/changes/*/.debug-context.md
openspec/changes/*/.plan-context.md
openspec/changes/*/.session-state.md

# Project-owned Codex memory workflow; keep other personal/platform assets ignored.
!.codex/
.codex/*
!.codex/config.toml
!.codex/hooks.json
!.codex/trellis.md
!.codex/spec-writing.md
!.codex/README.md
